{"info":{"_postman_id":"a7c1d2e3-4444-4b7c-9d8e-9f0a1b2c3d4e","name":"ARKCafe NCR - Security Tests","description":"Black-box security tests for the ARKCafe / Crimson NCR Django project.\n\nFolders:\n  1. Transport & browser-security headers\n  2. Authentication & session integrity\n  3. CSRF enforcement\n  4. Authorization (vertical + horizontal)\n  5. Injection & input validation\n  6. Method tampering & state safety\n  7. Hardening gaps (EXPECTED TO FAIL until the app is hardened)\n\nFolders 1-6 must be green. Folder 7 asserts behaviour the app does not have yet\n(CSP / no-store cache headers / login throttling), so it stays red until hardened.\n\nEvery folder starts with 0a/0b (GET /login/ + POST /logout/) and every login step\nasserts WHICH dashboard it landed on. That is deliberate: accounts/views.py uses\nredirect_authenticated_user=True, so posting the login form while a session exists\nredirects instead of switching accounts - without those guards a leftover session\nmakes the role-isolation checks test the wrong user.\n\nFolders 4-7 need the IDs captured in folder 4. Run the whole collection in order;\nsteps whose ID is missing skip themselves instead of failing with a 404.\n\nNon-destructive except that folders 4 and 5 create NCR records (there is no NCR\ndelete endpoint). No project, department or user is created or deleted.\n\nPrereqs: dev server on {{baseUrl}}, environment 'ARKCafe - Local Dev' selected,\nat least one Project and one Department in the DB.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. Transport & browser-security headers","item":[{"name":"0a. GET /login/ (fresh CSRF cookie, clear run state)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["['projectId','departmentId','ncrId','xssId','csrfBefore','secUniq','xssUniq']","  .forEach(function(k){ pm.collectionVariables.unset(k); });"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login route reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"description":"Also gives the next step a csrftoken cookie so POST /logout/ is not refused.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"0b. POST /logout/ (ensure signed out)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));","pm.test('No session cookie remains', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('sessionid') || '').to.eql(''));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"description":"Clears any session left by an earlier run so the next steps really are anonymous.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"1. Login page sets browser-security headers","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Page served', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));","pm.test('X-Frame-Options: DENY (clickjacking)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Frame-Options')).to.eql('DENY'));","pm.test('X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff (MIME sniffing)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Content-Type-Options')).to.eql('nosniff'));","pm.test('Referrer-Policy is not missing', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Referrer-Policy')).to.be.a('string'));","pm.test('No X-Powered-By technology banner', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Powered-By')).to.be.oneOf([null, undefined]));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. CSRF cookie is set with SameSite=Lax","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('csrftoken cookie present', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('csrftoken')).to.be.a('string'));","pm.test('csrftoken is SameSite=Lax', () => {","  const raw = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '';","  pm.expect(raw.toLowerCase()).to.include('csrftoken');","  pm.expect(raw.toLowerCase()).to.include('samesite=lax');","});"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"3. Protected page is not rendered to an anonymous client","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Redirected, not served (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Redirect target is the login page', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/login/'));","pm.test('No project data leaked in the redirect body', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('admin-projects/'));","pm.test('Security headers still applied on the redirect', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Frame-Options')).to.eql('DENY'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/"}}]},{"name":"2. Authentication & session integrity","item":[{"name":"0a. GET /login/ (fresh CSRF cookie, clear run state)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["['projectId','departmentId','ncrId','xssId','csrfBefore','secUniq','xssUniq']","  .forEach(function(k){ pm.collectionVariables.unset(k); });"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login route reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"description":"Also gives the next step a csrftoken cookie so POST /logout/ is not refused.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"0b. POST /logout/ (ensure signed out)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));","pm.test('No session cookie remains', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('sessionid') || '').to.eql(''));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"description":"Clears any session left by an earlier run so the next steps really are anonymous.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"1. Wrong password: rejected, no session, no account oracle","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Re-renders the form (200, no redirect)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('No session created', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.false);","pm.test('Generic error message', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Incorrect email or password'));","pm.test('Password is not echoed back into the page', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('wrong-password-123'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"wrong-password-123","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. Unknown email gives the same error (no user enumeration)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Same generic message as a wrong password', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Incorrect email or password'));","pm.test('No session created', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.false);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"description":"Identical response for 'unknown user' and 'bad password' prevents account discovery.","body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"ghost-user-{{$timestamp}}@nowhere.test","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"wrong-password-123","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"3. Capture the CSRF token before login","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["const t = pm.cookies.get('csrftoken');","if (t) pm.collectionVariables.set('csrfBefore', t);","pm.test('Pre-login CSRF token captured', () => pm.expect(!!t).to.be.true);"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"4. Staff login rotates the CSRF token and sets a hardened cookie","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login accepted (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Session cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);","pm.test('Landed on the staff dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/staff-dashboard|staff\\/dashboard/));","pm.test('CSRF token rotated on login', () => {","  const before = pm.collectionVariables.get('csrfBefore');","  const after = pm.cookies.get('csrftoken');","  pm.expect(after).to.be.a('string');","  pm.expect(after).to.not.eql(before);","});","pm.test('sessionid is HttpOnly', () => {","  const raw = (pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '').toLowerCase();","  pm.expect(raw).to.include('sessionid');","  pm.expect(raw).to.include('httponly');","});","pm.test('sessionid is SameSite', () =>","  pm.expect((pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie') || '').toLowerCase()).to.include('samesite'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"5. Logout cannot be triggered by GET (CSRF-free state change)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Method Not Allowed (405)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(405));","pm.test('Session is still valid after the GET attempt', () => {","  pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true;","});"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"description":"A GET-triggered logout would let any page log a user out (CSRF / nuisance attack).","url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}}]},{"name":"3. CSRF enforcement","item":[{"name":"0a. GET /login/ (fresh CSRF cookie, clear run state)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["['projectId','departmentId','ncrId','xssId','csrfBefore','secUniq','xssUniq']","  .forEach(function(k){ pm.collectionVariables.unset(k); });"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login route reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"description":"Also gives the next step a csrftoken cookie so POST /logout/ is not refused.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"0b. POST /logout/ (ensure signed out)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));","pm.test('No session cookie remains', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('sessionid') || '').to.eql(''));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"description":"Clears any session left by an earlier run so the next steps really are anonymous.","url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"1. POST /login/ with no CSRF token is refused","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Forbidden (403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(403));","pm.test('Blocked by CSRF, not by credentials', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text().toLowerCase()).to.include('csrf'));","pm.test('No session issued', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('sessionid') || '').to.eql(''));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[],"description":"No X-CSRFToken header and no csrfmiddlewaretoken field are sent.","body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. POST /login/ with a forged CSRF token is refused","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Forbidden (403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(403));","pm.test('No session issued', () => pm.expect(pm.cookies.get('sessionid') || '').to.eql(''));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"forged-token-value-0000000000000000"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"3. GET /login/ (fresh token for the admin session)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login page reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"4. POST login as ADMIN","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login accepted (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Session cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);","pm.test('Landed on the admin dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/admin-dashboard|reports\\/admin\\/dashboard/));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{adminEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{adminPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"5. Admin write WITHOUT a CSRF token is refused","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Forbidden (403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(403));","pm.test('Not created (no 302 redirect)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(302));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[],"description":"A valid admin session alone must not be enough to mutate data.","body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project_name","value":"CSRF Probe","type":"text"},{"key":"client_name","value":"CSRF Probe","type":"text"},{"key":"project_code","value":"CSRF-NOTOKEN","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"must not be created","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/add/"}},{"name":"6. Admin write with a forged CSRF token is refused","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Forbidden (403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(403));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"forged-token-value-0000000000000000"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project_name","value":"CSRF Probe","type":"text"},{"key":"client_name","value":"CSRF Probe","type":"text"},{"key":"project_code","value":"CSRF-FORGED","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"must not be created","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/add/"}},{"name":"7. The CSRF-blocked writes created nothing","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('List page renders (admin session is valid)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('It really is the project list, not a login redirect', () => {","  const b = pm.response.text();","  pm.expect(b).to.not.include('name=\"username\"');","  pm.expect(b).to.include('admin-projects');","});","pm.test('No CSRF-NOTOKEN project exists', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('CSRF-NOTOKEN'));","pm.test('No CSRF-FORGED project exists', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('CSRF-FORGED'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/?q=CSRF-"}}]},{"name":"4. Authorization (vertical + horizontal)","item":[{"name":"1. POST /logout/ (start anonymous)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"2. Anonymous access to the staff export endpoint is refused","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Redirected to login', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Location is the login page', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/login/'));","pm.test('No export body leaked', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('spreadsheetml'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff/export/"}},{"name":"3. POST login as STAFF","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login accepted (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Session cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);","pm.test('Landed on the staff dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/staff-dashboard|staff\\/dashboard/));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"4. Staff cannot open the admin user-management page","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Not served (never 200)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(200));","pm.test('Redirected to the staff dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('staff'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-users/"}},{"name":"5. Staff cannot list projects","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Denied: 302 (core.decorators) or 403 (project_views)', () =>","  pm.expect([302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/"}},{"name":"6. Staff cannot create a project (privilege escalation attempt)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Not created (never 200)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(200));","pm.test('Denied with 403 or 302', () =>","  pm.expect([302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project_name","value":"Escalated","type":"text"},{"key":"client_name","value":"Escalated","type":"text"},{"key":"project_code","value":"ESCALATED-1","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"must not be created","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/add/"}},{"name":"7. Staff cannot create an admin user","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Not created (never 200)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(200));","pm.test('Denied with 403 or 302', () =>","  pm.expect([302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"action","value":"add","type":"text"},{"key":"add-full_name","value":"Escalated User","type":"text"},{"key":"add-email","value":"escalated@nowhere.test","type":"text"},{"key":"add-role","value":"admin","type":"text"},{"key":"add-mobile_number","value":"09170000000","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-users/"}},{"name":"8. Staff create form exposes project/department IDs","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Create form 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","const body = pm.response.text();","const pSel = body.match(/name=\"project\"[\\s\\S]*?<\\/select>/);","const pOpt = pSel && pSel[0].match(/<option value=\"(\\d+)\"/);","const dSel = body.match(/name=\"department\"[\\s\\S]*?<\\/select>/);","const dOpt = dSel && dSel[0].match(/<option value=\"(\\d+)\"/);","if (pOpt) pm.collectionVariables.set('projectId', pOpt[1]);","if (dOpt) pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentId', dOpt[1]);","pm.test('Seed project + department available', () => pm.expect(!!pOpt && !!dOpt).to.be.true);"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-create/"}},{"name":"9. Staff creates an NCR (fixture for the horizontal-access checks)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.collectionVariables.set('secUniq', Date.now());"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('NCR created (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","const m = (pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').match(/staff-records\\/(\\d+)\\//);","pm.test('New NCR id captured', () => pm.expect(!!m).to.be.true);","if (m) pm.collectionVariables.set('ncrId', m[1]);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"